    Resonance Kill - Standalone
    Target selection + Kill functionality
    Extracted from Resonance v2.9 (crack by InLoad and wraith.dev)

    Game: Fling Things and People (6961824067)

    Usage:
      1. Execute in FTAP
      2. Click a player in the list to select
      3. Click "Kill Selected"  (or use RightShift to toggle UI)
      4. "Kill All" kills everyone

    Public API:
      getgenv().ResonanceKill.Kill(player)  -- kill any player
      getgenv().ResonanceKillUnload()       -- unload everything
      getgenv().ResonanceKillShow() / Hide() -- toggle UI
]]

